  "historyNote": "#9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1505.02); ss by #13758, eff 9-28-23; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
